{"id":"amante","lemma":"amante","pos":"noun","rank":1306,"glosses":["lover (one who loves another person)","lover (a sexual partner, especially one with whom someone is having an affair)","lover (a person who loves something)"],"ipa":"/aˈmante/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"amantes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-amante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los amantes iban del brazo.","en":"The lovers were walking arm in arm.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"arm in arm"]]},{"text":"Los amantes se besaron.","en":"The lovers kissed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449309","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to kiss","l":"besar"}]},{"text":"La vieron en un restaurante con su amante.","en":"She was seen at a restaurant with her lover.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"restaurant"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Los amantes se intercambiaron varias cartas.","en":"The lovers exchanged numerous letters.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689346","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to interchange","l":"intercambiar"},{"g":"various","l":"vario"},{"g":"letter","l":"carta"}]},{"text":"Soy un amante de la belleza en todas sus formas.","en":"I'm a lover of beauty in all its forms.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,{"g":"beauty"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"shape","l":"forma"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]}]}